  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Снайпер</span> <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Арена</span></strong></h1><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">Эта карта создана для тренировки стрельбы с помощью мода для оружия.</span></p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">Объекты</span></strong></h1><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">· МАГАЗИН</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">· Крытая стрельбище = 5–100 м</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">· Открытая стрельбище</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">· Крытая зона для ближнего боя</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">· Открытая зона для ближнего боя</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">· Тест отдачи</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">· Тест на пробитие</span></span></p><hr><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Необходимые моды</span></strong></h3><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">·</span>[TaCZ] Timeless and Classics Zero &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero</a></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">·</span>Vic's Point Blank <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vics-point-blank\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vics-point-blank</a></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">（Моды, кроме TaCZ и Vic's, также подойдут</span><span style=\"color:#fff\">）</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">·</span>MmmMmmMmmMmm (Манекен-мишень)</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm</a></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">+</span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">версия 2.0 ~</span></h1><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">・</span></span><span style=\"font-weight:400\">CustomNPCs-Unofficial</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customnpcs-unofficial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customnpcs-unofficial</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">・</span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Advanced Shulkerboxes</span></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-shulkerboxes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-shulkerboxes</a></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">+</h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">версия 4.0~</h1><p>・SDM Shop</p><p>　<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-shop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-shop</a></p><p>・SDM &nbsp;Economy</p><p>　<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-economy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-economy</a></p><p>・SDM Engine Core</p><p>　<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-engine-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-engine-core</a></p><p>・SDM UI Lib&nbsp;</p><p>　<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-ui-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-ui-lib</a></p><p>・FTB Library&nbsp;</p><p>　<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-library-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-library-forge</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Если вы скачали мод отдельно для одного мира, поместите папку SDMShop в папку config.</p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">Объект</span></strong></h1><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">・МАГАЗИН</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">・крытая стрельбище = 5~100 м</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">・открытое стрельбище</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">・крытый полигон для CQB</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">・открытый полигон для CQB</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">・испытание отдачи</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">・Испытание на пробитие</span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Необходимые моды</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">・</span>[TaCZ] Timeless and Classics Zero &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero</a></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">・</span>Vic's Point Blank <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vics-point-blank\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vics-point-blank</a></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; (Допустимы и другие моды, кроме TaCZ и Vic's)</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">・</span>MmmMmmMmmMmm (Манекен-мишень)</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm</a></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">+</span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">версия 2.0 ~</span></h1><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">・</span></span><span style=\"font-weight:400\">CustomNPCs-Unofficial</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customnpcs-unofficial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customnpcs-unofficial</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">・</span></span><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Усовершенствованные шулькербоксы</span></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-shulkerboxes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-shulkerboxes</a></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">+</h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">версия 4.0~</h1><p>・Магазин SDM</p><p>　<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-shop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-shop</a></p><p>・Экономика SDM</p><p>　<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-economy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-economy</a></p><p>・Ядро движка SDM</p><p>　<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-engine-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-engine-core</a></p><p>・Библиотека UI SDM</p><p>　<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-ui-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdm-ui-lib</a></p><p>・Библиотека FTB</p><p>　<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-library-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-library-forge</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Если вы скачали отдельный мир, поместите папку SDMShop внутрь папки config.</p><hr><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Крытый тир</span></strong></h3><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1363834/description_a006818e-4333-4088-9872-8adb223dc094.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"439\"></p><hr><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Открытый тир</span></strong></h3><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1363834/description_d0b5f67d-fcb3-440a-8bdb-0ad8b476df97.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"439\"></p><hr><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Крытый полигон для ближнего боя</span></strong></h3><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1363834/description_fbb0b94f-921e-437f-8e19-e1d4fcb2f380.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"439\"></p><hr><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Открытый полигон для ближнего боя</span></strong></h3><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1363834/description_a70f98e4-ed69-4449-b7f2-3f72b20284f0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"439\"></strong></p><hr><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Испытание отдачи</span></strong><img style=\"text-align:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1363834/description_eb2b8daa-3cc1-4915-a25b-3b46ad729a7c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"439\"></h3><hr><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Испытание на проникновение</span></strong></h3><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1363834/description_75443810-98ee-47ed-b67b-5198256487b4.png\" alt=\"\"></p><hr><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">МАГАЗИН</span></strong></h3><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1363834/description_333f6fc8-66da-4e36-9562-2268fdb3add4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
